-- A rule with the name of a computed field of a record. The checker takes it
-- for that field (smucclaw/l4-ide#1038, not yet fixed), so `l4 export dmn`
-- leaves it out, and with nothing else to export it refuses. The refusal
-- names the rule; before, it said the module had no DECIDE or MEANS.
DECLARE Employee HAS salary IS A NUMBER
                     bonus IS A NUMBER MEANS salary * 0.1

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE bonus n IS n * 2
